{"title":"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Penni Precisely buys \\$100 worth of stock in each of three companies: Alabama Almonds, Boston Beans, and California Cauliflower.  After one year, AA was up 20%, BB was down 25%, and CC was unchanged.  For the second year, AA was down 20% from the previous year, BB was up 25% from the previous year, and CC was unchanged.  If A, B, and C are the final values of the stock, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/5/5b54c3f506d0161c7abc34f96381eae0784bc815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ A=B=C \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ A=B&lt;C \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ C&lt;B=A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"431\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca3ae88d71116381af82eb7dd4845a43ed97d899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}\\ A&lt;B&lt;C \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ B&lt;A&lt;C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>AA is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/38980cb97ab6795fa88378fdaa171151de61a205.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 120\\% = 100\\cdot 1.2 = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"221\" height=\"14\" /> after one year.  After the second year, AA is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/e/00e94f3a417a06c7a48aa834c19b476bca8809bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120\\cdot 0.8 = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>BB is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/8/ba8c4aff2ba859e0fb7b7a02e5f48e2182521bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 75\\% = 100\\cdot 0.75 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"212\" height=\"14\" /> after one year.  After the second year, BB is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/3061a3ea92f2989ac82acfde3397ae3c80d620ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75\\cdot 1.25 = 93.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>CC remains unchanged throughout, and stays at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/3/0c366e4ab034394979c63631869b2dc1cbb89bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B &lt; A &lt; C$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />, and the right answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>AA will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/e/f3ea5fbbf4ae16b7e9afc193e17fb6f1aa8fe5a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot \\frac{6}{5} \\cdot \\frac{4}{5} = 100\\cdot \\frac{24}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"165\" height=\"37\" /> at the end.\n</p><p>BB will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9d533a6538a9a92124edfcd2184d385f59dcc0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} = 100 \\cdot \\frac{15}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"165\" height=\"38\" /> at the end.\n</p><p>CC will be unchanged at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since all the fractions are under <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> will be highest value.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/6/8b601a2ec39e0eaad90a11bfe6d73326b642ee76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf22b5f15c480811167e502caba25399206589ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44b9221d8b367b89afb1b04d96ebca8d0009dcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdbf3a5d28b40defc7a0dd417b8f6d282bc60de6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/6/8b601a2ec39e0eaad90a11bfe6d73326b642ee76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and will be closer to the original value.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/3/0c366e4ab034394979c63631869b2dc1cbb89bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B &lt; A &lt; C$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />, and the right answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME\" title=\"1997 AJHSME\">1997 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME\">AJHSME</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME Problems and Solutions\">AJHSME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016194028\nCache e